 153           before.usage !== null && after.usage !== null ? usd(after.usage - before.usage) : "n/a"
 154         } by the key's own usage counter.`
 155       : dryRun
 156         ? "OpenRouter key: not queried (dry run)."
 157         : "OpenRouter key: couldn't read /api/v1/key.";
